<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24554" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβῐ-όω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώσομαι</span>: aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εβίων,</span>
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βιῶναι</span> (also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βιῶσαι: ζῆσαι,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>): pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βεβίωκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					9.70
				</span></i>
			:—<i>live through, pass,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					730c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Men.</u>
					81b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἐνθάδε χρόνον</span>
			Isoc.l.c.: abs., <i>spend one's whole life,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. δικαίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					526a
				</span></i>
			: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελετῶν διαβεβιωκέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.8.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>survive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἀπὸ χρημάτων</span>
			<i>live</i> on, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Publ.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
